Files copied once into place and then left alone, because the tool that owns
them rewrites them (nwg-look, qt6ct, kvantum) or because they are per-machine
choices. `install` never overwrites an existing file.

  gtk-3.0, gtk-4.0     GTK theme, icons, cursor
  qt6ct, Kvantum       Qt theme
  icons-default        cursor theme for applications that ignore GTK settings
  xdg-desktop-portal   which portal backend serves which interface under sway
  browser              keyring password store for Chromium, VS Code, Electron
